WEBVTT

00:00:02.381 --> 00:00:04.495
ON OLD McGONAGALL'S FACE
IF WE WERE LATE?

00:00:08.978 --> 00:00:10.849
THAT WAS
BLOODY BRILLIANT.

00:00:10.893 --> 00:00:13.983
OH, THANK YOU FOR THAT
ASSESSMENT, MR. WEASLEY.

00:00:14.026 --> 00:00:15.506
PERHAPS IT WOULD BE
MORE USEFUL

00:00:15.549 --> 00:00:17.421
IF I WERE TO TRANSFIGURE
MR. POTTER AND YOURSELF

00:00:17.464 --> 00:00:18.639
INTO A POCKET WATCH?

00:00:18.683 --> 00:00:20.424
THAT WAY, ONE OF YOU
MIGHT BE ON TIME.

00:00:20.467 --> 00:00:22.339
WE GOT LOST.

00:00:22.382 --> 00:00:24.341
THEN PERHAPS A MAP?

00:00:24.384 --> 00:00:26.734
I TRUST YOU DON'T NEED ONE
TO FIND YOUR SEATS?

00:00:31.348 --> 00:00:33.350
[STUDENTS TALKING SOFTLY]

00:00:36.092 --> 00:00:37.789
THERE WILL BE
NO FOOLISH WAND-WAVING

00:00:37.833 --> 00:00:41.837
OR SILLY INCANTATIONS
IN THIS CLASS.

00:00:41.880 --> 00:00:45.188
AS SUCH, I DON'T
EXPECT MANY OF YOU

00:00:45.231 --> 00:00:46.842
TO APPRECIATE
THE SUBTLE SCIENCE

00:00:46.885 --> 00:00:49.192
AND EXACT ART
THAT IS POTION MAKING.

00:00:49.235 --> 00:00:53.892
HOWEVER, FOR THOSE
SELECT FEW...

00:00:53.936 --> 00:00:57.243
WHO POSSESS
THE PREDISPOSITION...

00:01:00.594 --> 00:01:04.424
I CAN TEACH YOU HOW
TO BEWITCH THE MIND

00:01:04.468 --> 00:01:07.210
AND ENSNARE THE SENSES.

00:01:07.253 --> 00:01:10.082
I CAN TELL YOU
HOW TO BOTTLE FAME,

00:01:10.126 --> 00:01:11.518
BREW GLORY,

00:01:11.562 --> 00:01:15.566
AND EVEN PUT
A STOPPER IN DEATH.

00:01:20.440 --> 00:01:23.922
THEN AGAIN,
MAYBE SOME OF YOU

00:01:23.966 --> 00:01:25.141
HAVE COME TO HOGWARTS

00:01:25.184 --> 00:01:27.795
IN POSSESSION OF
ABILITIES SO FORMIDABLE

00:01:27.839 --> 00:01:30.320
THAT YOU FEEL
CONFIDENT ENOUGH

00:01:30.363 --> 00:01:33.627
TO NOT PAY ATTENTION.

00:01:40.286 --> 00:01:42.158
MR. POTTER.

00:01:43.942 --> 00:01:48.120
OUR NEW CELEBRITY.

00:01:49.861 --> 00:01:51.602
TELL ME,
WHAT WOULD I GET

00:01:51.645 --> 00:01:53.169
IF ADDED POWDERED
ROOT OF ASPHODEL

00:01:53.212 --> 00:01:54.779
TO AN INFUSION
OF WORMWOOD?

00:01:54.822 --> 00:01:55.954
[GASPS]

00:01:59.131 --> 00:02:00.350
YOU DON'T KNOW?

00:02:00.393 --> 00:02:02.134
WELL, LET'S TRY AGAIN.

00:02:02.178 --> 00:02:03.309
WHERE, MR. POTTER,
WOULD YOU LOOK

00:02:03.353 --> 00:02:05.094
IF I ASKED YOU
TO FIND ME A BEZOAR?

00:02:07.661 --> 00:02:09.272
I DON'T KNOW, SIR.

00:02:09.315 --> 00:02:10.664
AND WHAT IS
THE DIFFERENCE

00:02:10.708 --> 00:02:12.231
BETWEEN MONKSHOOD
AND WOLFBANE?

00:02:12.275 --> 00:02:14.103
OH!

00:02:15.495 --> 00:02:17.280
I DON'T KNOW, SIR.

00:02:18.890 --> 00:02:20.500
PITY.

00:02:22.285 --> 00:02:27.072
CLEARLY, FAME
ISN'T EVERYTHING...

00:02:27.116 --> 00:02:29.031
IS IT, MR. POTTER?

00:02:32.034 --> 00:02:34.210
EYE OF RABBIT,
HARP STRING HUM.

00:02:34.253 --> 00:02:36.908
TURN THIS WATER
INTO RUM.

00:02:38.910 --> 00:02:41.130
EYE OF RABBIT,
HARP STRING HUM...

00:02:41.173 --> 00:02:42.305
WHAT'S SEAMUS
TRYING TO DO

00:02:42.348 --> 00:02:43.436
TO THAT GLASS
OF WATER?

00:02:43.480 --> 00:02:45.873
TURN IT TO RUM.
ACTUALLY MANAGED

00:02:45.917 --> 00:02:48.224
A WEAK TEA
YESTERDAY, BEFORE...

00:02:48.267 --> 00:02:50.052
[BOOM]

00:02:50.095 --> 00:02:52.097
[LAUGHTER]

00:02:53.142 --> 00:02:54.230
[OWL SCREECHES]

00:02:54.273 --> 00:02:56.536
AH! MAIL'S HERE!

00:03:04.153 --> 00:03:06.242
[OWLS SCREECHING]

00:03:29.439 --> 00:03:31.223
CAN I BORROW THIS?

00:03:31.267 --> 00:03:32.398
THANKS.

00:03:36.228 --> 00:03:37.186
HEY, LOOK!

00:03:37.229 --> 00:03:38.622
NEVILLE'S GOT
A REMEMBRALL.

00:03:38.665 --> 00:03:40.189
I'VE READ ABOUT THOSE.

00:03:40.232 --> 00:03:41.799
WHEN THE SMOKE TURNS RED,

00:03:41.842 --> 00:03:44.236
IT MEANS YOU'VE
FORGOTTEN SOMETHING.

00:03:44.280 --> 00:03:45.803
THE ONLY PROBLEM IS,

00:03:45.846 --> 00:03:47.935
I CAN'T REMEMBER
WHAT I'VE FORGOTTEN.

00:03:47.979 --> 00:03:49.459
HEY, RON.

00:03:49.502 --> 00:03:51.417
SOMEBODY BROKE
INTO GRINGOTTS.

00:03:51.461 --> 00:03:52.897
LISTEN.

00:03:52.940 --> 00:03:54.203
"BELIEVED TO BE THE WORK

00:03:54.246 --> 00:03:56.205
"OF DARK WIZARDS
OR WITCHES UNKNOWN.

00:03:56.248 --> 00:03:57.510
"GRINGOTTS GOBLINS,

00:03:57.554 --> 00:03:59.034
"WHILE ACKNOWLEDGING
THE BREACH,

00:03:59.077 --> 00:04:00.992
"INSIST NOTHING WAS TAKEN.

00:04:01.036 --> 00:04:03.429
"THE VAULT IN QUESTION,
NUMBER 713,

00:04:03.473 --> 00:04:06.867
HAD, IN FACT, BEEN EMPTIED
EARLIER THAT VERY SAME DAY."

00:04:06.911 --> 00:04:08.695
THAT'S ODD.

00:04:08.739 --> 00:04:11.742
THAT'S THE VAULT
HAGRID AND I WENT TO.

00:04:20.664 --> 00:04:21.682
GOOD AFTERNOON, CLASS.
